'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a cape and a [[player card]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

==Acquisition==
This [[Cosmetics#Capes and Cards|cosmetic set]], found on page six of the [[Helldivers Mobilize Warbond#Page 6|Helldivers Mobilize!]] [[Warbond]], can be claimed separately for {{Currency|Medals|15|notext}} and 6 [[Medal]]s.

==Trivia==
The [[Helldiver]] in {{PAGENAME}}'s Warbond cape icon wears the [[SA-04 Combat Technician]] [[helmet]] instead of the usual [[B-01 Tactical]], this is the only deviation of its kind.

